{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484593,"name":"Steve Clements","username":"Steve_Grayt","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/82dd89/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T14:04:12.546Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484593-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484593-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484593-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484593-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy Grok Bot Agent Computer is unreachable on both iPhone and desktop. All bots on the account are dead, including Chief of Staff.\u003cbr\u003e\nThe iOS app shows: “Couldn’t refresh — showing the last loaded messages.” Messages I send appear as black bubbles and never get a reply.\u003cbr\u003e\nOvernight the bots stopped working. I reset the Agent Computer. It came back for about 45 minutes, then died again. I fully quit the app, signed out, and signed back in. The computer would not restart. Reset Grok Bot’s Computer now fails with an error that it cannot be reset / the computer is in a partial or incomplete state.\u003cbr\u003e\nI then signed into Grok Bot on my computer with the same account. Same issue: computer won’t start, reset fails.\u003cbr\u003e\nThis is not one bad chat. The shared cloud computer is stuck. Please recover/rebuild the existing Agent Computer on the backend and keep my bots, chats, files, and logins. Do not have me keep hitting Reset. Client-side Reset and Recover cannot finish.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484593-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484593-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUse Grok Bot normally on iPhone. Overnight the bots stop responding.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen a conversation (Chief of Staff). The app shows “Couldn’t refresh — showing the last loaded messages.” Sent messages appear as black bubbles and get no reply.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset Grok Bot’s Computer. It comes back for about 45 minutes, then dies again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit the Grok Bot app and reopen it.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSign out and sign back in on iOS.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTry to restart/reconnect the Agent Computer. It does not start.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTry Reset Grok Bot’s Computer again. Reset fails with an error that it cannot be reset / the computer is in a partial or incomplete state.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSign in on desktop with the same account.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe desktop app hits the same state: computer will not start, reset fails.\u003cbr\u003e\nI cannot get past this from the client. It now happens every time I open Grok Bot on either device.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484593-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484593-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’d like to be able to communicate with my bots\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484593-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484593-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/6/d/6d94a96ea910783540950d82f672df6999a81237.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/fDoy9k2ifEqm5JHR9nkxwcj37ZZ.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"IMG_5302.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/d/6d94a96ea910783540950d82f672df6999a81237_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_5302.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"fDoy9k2ifEqm5JHR9nkxwcj37ZZ\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/d/6d94a96ea910783540950d82f672df6999a81237_2_230x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/d/6d94a96ea910783540950d82f672df6999a81237_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/d/6d94a96ea910783540950d82f672df6999a81237_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_5302.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1320×2868 92.7 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/1/1/11383c4d0312fc9f1aac12b7ed8942484de1c093.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/2skBgESVEG0jU10AxOlnjow8667.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"IMG_5303.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/1/1/11383c4d0312fc9f1aac12b7ed8942484de1c093_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_5303.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"2skBgESVEG0jU10AxOlnjow8667\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/1/1/11383c4d0312fc9f1aac12b7ed8942484de1c093_2_230x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/1/1/11383c4d0312fc9f1aac12b7ed8942484de1c093_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/1/1/11383c4d0312fc9f1aac12b7ed8942484de1c093_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F0F0F0\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_5303.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1320×2868 136 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/e/c/ece1ddfc46b8048dd150653673a433b7f6da1592.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/xNyBgI7vvQyl4KmaIwgnLsDc76O.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"IMG_5304.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/c/ece1ddfc46b8048dd150653673a433b7f6da1592_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_5304.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"xNyBgI7vvQyl4KmaIwgnLsDc76O\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/c/ece1ddfc46b8048dd150653673a433b7f6da1592_2_230x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/c/ece1ddfc46b8048dd150653673a433b7f6da1592_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/c/ece1ddfc46b8048dd150653673a433b7f6da1592_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"C1C2C4\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_5304.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1320×2868 186 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484593-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484593-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003cbr\u003e\niOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484593-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484593-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 1.0\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484593-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484593-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T14:04:23.125Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":8,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":41.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":170804,"topic_slug":"grok-bots-not-responding","display_username":"Steve Clements","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136448,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bots-not-responding/170804/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":484615,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T14:55:08.738Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. I can see the screenshots showing “Something went wrong”, “Couldn’t check for a newer version”, and “Reset failed”. The main thing first, your computer, bots, chats, files, and logins are safe. Nothing was lost. Your computer didn’t actually break.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe cause is different. Your account doesn’t have an explicit Privacy Mode choice saved yet. During signup, you only confirmed the data notice. Grok Bot on your devices can’t connect to your computer until that choice is saved, so every connection attempt gets rejected. That’s why you see “Couldn’t refresh”, messages with no replies (black bubbles), and “Reset failed”. Reset, Retry, and Recover won’t fix this, so please don’t keep pressing them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to unblock it:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/dashboard\"\u003ecursor.com/dashboard\u003c/a\u003e in your browser and sign in with the same account you use in Grok Bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Settings and find the Privacy section.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSelect Privacy Mode (not the Legacy option), keep the data sharing settings however you want, and confirm.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn Mac, fully quit Grok Bot with \u003ccode\u003eCmd+Q\u003c/code\u003e and reopen it. On iPhone, swipe the app away and open it again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWait about a minute. If it still says Reconnecting, press Retry once.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bots should connect within a couple of minutes. Messages sent during the outage may need to be sent again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf it still won’t connect after these steps, send the time you tried, including your timezone, and we’ll dig in.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T14:55:08.738Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":6.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170804,"topic_slug":"grok-bots-not-responding","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cursor.com/dashboard","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":3}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bots-not-responding/170804/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[484593,484615]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bots not responding","id":170804,"title":"Grok Bots not responding","posts_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-06T14:04:12.490Z","views":26,"reply_count":0,"like_count":0,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-06T14:55:08.738Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"grok-bots-not-responding","category_id":6,"word_count":650,"deleted_at":null,"user_id":136448,"featured_link":null,"pinned_globally":false,"pinned_at":null,"pinned_until":null,"image_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/d/6d94a96ea910783540950d82f6